  {"say": "A retractable main landing gear, shown with the aircraft on jacks. The leg turns about the trunnion. A folding side brace holds it down.", "camera": "front", "orbit": -18,
   "focus": ["airframe", "leg", "tire"], "annotate": ["lTrunnion", "lLeg", "lUpper", "lLower", "lAct"]},
  {"say": "The side brace has two links. With the gear down, the knee joint between them sits a little past the straight line and rests on a stop. This is the over-centre lock.", "camera": "front",
   "focus": ["upper", "lower"], "annotate": ["lKnee", "lStop"]},
  {"say": "A side load on the wheel tries to fold the gear, and it squeezes the brace. The knee is already past the straight line, so the squeeze pushes it harder onto the stop. The gear cannot fold.", "camera": "front",
   "focus": ["airframe", "leg", "tire"], "highlight": ["upper", "lower"], "annotate": ["aLoad", "aSqueezeA", "aSqueezeB", "aKnee"]},
  {"say": "The pin at the end of the lower link joins the leg. The engine checked these two pin-to-leg distances at each shown pose.", "camera": "front",
   "focus": ["leg", "tire"], "annotate": ["pinA", "pinB"], "check": [{"value": "dim.pinA", "eq": 100, "tol": 1e-6}, {"value": "dim.pinB", "eq": 500, "tol": 1e-6}]},
  {"say": "In this example, an unlock actuator (not shown) moves the knee back through centre before retraction. Here the brace is exactly straight.", "camera": "front",
